		(descr "Same Sky CRJ068-1-SMT vertical 8P8C, reflow SMT. Same pattern as the puck's footprint, with the two shield-flange pads NUMBERED SH - at this end the cable screen grounds, so the shell ties to the SHLD net. 8 signal pads 3.10 x 0.60 at 1.27 pitch (row 8.89), pad centers x +9.15; two shield pads 2.70 x 1.50 at x -8.95, y +/-4.50. Body 16.1 x 19.5, 13.0 tall, 0.1 standoff. Origin at pattern center.")
